        "diversions": "<p><strong>Light vehicles: </strong>Segenhoe St and St Heliers St.</p><p><strong>All vehicles -</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Southbound from Scone:</strong> St Aubins St, Aberdeen St, Liverpool St, Satur Rd, Bunnan Rd, Scone Rd, Vennacher St, Golden Hwy, Denman Rd, and Sydney St to New England Hwy.</li><li><strong>Northbound from Muswellbrook:</strong> Sydney St, Denman Rd, Golden Hwy, Vennacher St, Scone Rd, Bunnan Rd, Satur Rd, Liverpool St, Aberdeen St, and St Aubins St to New England Hwy.</li></ul><p>This route will add around 90 minutes of additional travel time.</p><p><strong>Note: </strong>The clearance height of the Liverpool St bridge is 5.0m (Parsons Gully)</p><p>Unless specified otherwise, operators of Class 1,2 &amp; 3 vehicles travelling under a Notice <strong>must</strong> consult their relevant enforceable network map to confirm a suitable <strong>approved</strong> alternative route.</p><p>Operators of Class 1, 2 &amp; 3 vehicles travelling under a Permit <strong>must not</strong> travel off the approved route listed in the permit unless an updated permit is obtained from the NHVR.</p>",
